  "edits": [
    "Native existing-character join/auth/CSRF/realm/bot rules extracted mechanically",
    "Native creation registration gate, normalized name, role, capacity, spawn, starter ledger and weapon statements extracted mechanically",
    "Writer facade removes await/async; native auth uses asynchronous facade",
    "Writer reads original settings SELECTs/defaults/policy without asynchronous cache or Promise.all",
